    {
      "content": "<p>Selecting an apartment can be a lot to handle when you're trying to figure out if the location works for you. A good spot can make your everyday life easier, while a bad one might lead to stress and hassle. Let's look at some things to think about when you're deciding if an apartment's location is right for you.<br><h2><b>Table of Contents</b></h2></p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000729001\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">The first thing you should check when looking at an apartment's location is how far it is from your job or school. Long trips to and from work or class can wear you out and affect how you live your life. Here's how to look at this part:&nbsp;<br></span></p><h3><b>Distance and Commute Time</b></h3><p>Figure out the exact distance from the apartment to your workplace or school. Check online maps or a commute app to get an idea of travel time during rush hour. A shorter commute makes your daily routine easier. Try to keep your commute under 30 minutes if you can.<br><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000729001\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Table: Average Commute Times</b></span></p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"type\":\"solid\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"color\":\"rgb(0,0,0)\"},\"border-left\":{\"type\":\"solid\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"color\":\"rgb(0,0,0)\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"type\":\"solid\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"color\":\"rgb(0,0,0)\"},\"border-right\":{\"type\":\"solid\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"color\":\"rgb(0,0,0)\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"1.865in\"},{\"wt\":\"3.906in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"5.77in\" data-table-name=\"Table_1\" class=\"zw-table\" style=\"margin-left: 0in;\"><tbody><tr data-row-info=\"{\" type\":\"row\",\"id\":\"rw-saricfc7azy3\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"padding: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 179.04px; height: auto; border-width: 0.727273px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Commute Time</b></span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"padding: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 374.976px; height: auto; border-width: 0.727273px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Impact on Daily Life</b></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" type\":\"row\",\"id\":\"rw-rkbs7gemku9g\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"padding: 0.96px; vertical-align: middle; width: 179.04px; height: auto; border-width: 0.727273px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Under 15 minutes</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"padding: 0.96px; vertical-align: middle; width: 374.976px; height: auto; border-width: 0.727273px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Minimal impact, very convenient</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" type\":\"row\",\"id\":\"rw-oaywqn7q53eb\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"padding: 0.96px; vertical-align: middle; width: 179.04px; height: auto; border-width: 0.727273px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 15-30 minutes</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"padding: 0.96px; vertical-align: middle; width: 374.976px; height: auto; border-width: 0.727273px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Manageable with minor adjustments</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" type\":\"row\",\"id\":\"rw-ighayxm450s9\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"padding: 0.96px; vertical-align: middle; width: 179.04px; height: auto; border-width: 0.727273px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;30-60 minutes</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"padding: 0.96px; vertical-align: middle; width: 374.976px; height: auto; border-width: 0.727273px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Potential for stress, consider alternatives</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" type\":\"row\",\"id\":\"rw-g0eh4rfcovx6\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"padding: 0.96px; vertical-align: middle; width: 179.04px; height: auto; border-width: 0.727273px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Over 60 minutes</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"padding: 0.96px; vertical-align: middle; width: 374.976px; height: auto; border-width: 0.727273px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; High impact, could be stressful</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><b>Work and School Schedules</b></h3><p>If possible, visit the apartment at different times to understand how traffic might affect your commute. Also, consider the availability of flexible work hours or remote work options that might mitigate the impact of a longer commute.</p><div><br></div>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
