      "content": "<p>Access to reliable public transportation can greatly affect your daily convenience. Evaluating this aspect involves several considerations:<br></p><p></p><h3><b>Types of Public Transit</b></h3><p>Identify the types of public transportation available near the apartment, such as buses, subways, or trains. Check their routes, frequency, and reliability.<br><b>Table: Public Transit Options<br></b></p><p data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000729001\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span></p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"type\":\"solid\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"color\":\"rgb(0,0,0)\"},\"border-left\":{\"type\":\"solid\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"color\":\"rgb(0,0,0)\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"type\":\"solid\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"color\":\"rgb(0,0,0)\"},\"border-right\":{\"type\":\"solid\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"color\":\"rgb(0,0,0)\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"1.781in\"},{\"wt\":\"2.385in\"},{\"wt\":\"2.854in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"7.02in\" data-table-name=\"Table_2\" class=\"zw-table\" style=\"margin-left: 0in;\"><tbody><tr data-row-info=\"{\" type\":\"row\",\"id\":\"rw-ig3hxskom1ci\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 170.976px; height: auto; border-width: 0.727273px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"10.50\",\"fgc\":\"oklch(0.304=\"\" 0.04=\"\" 213.681)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><font color=\"oklch(0.304 0.04 213.681)\" fa